  cutSceneDataList:
  - symbol: BNB
    stage: 0
    name: Tiffany
    character: Tiffany
    position: left
    message: 'Hey there, I''m Tiffany Richmond and this is my amazing mansion.

      It''s
      hectic here, and I can''t keep calm because it''s my 30th birthday. Woohoo!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: BNB
    stage: 0
    name: Tiffany
    character: Tiffany
    position: left
    message: 'The soiree is tonight. Everything needs to look picture-perfect.

      My
      mansion is huge, and I have a very long to-do list.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: BNB
    stage: 0
    name: Tiffany
    character: Tiffany
    position: left
    message: 'Can you help me find the items I need? Pretty please!

      I want
      to be the most beautiful girl at the party tonight!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: BNB
    stage: 1
    name: Tiffany
    character: Tiffany
    position: left
    message: 'First things first, I need to get ready for this party.

      I need
      to check the schedule on my phone, but I seem to have misplaced it.

      Can
      you help me find it?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: BNB
    stage: 2
    name: Tiffany
    character: Tiffany
    position: left
    message: 'I have an appointment with my hair stylist in Beverly Hills, then some
      shopping to do before the party.

      But what should I wear while I''m out?
      I have to look good for the paparazzi!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: BNB
    stage: 3
    name: Tiffany
    character: Tiffany
    position: left
    message: 'I want my hair to look glamorous tonight.

      Where are the newest
      magazines? Maybe I can get some ideas from them.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: BNB
    stage: 4
    name: Tiffany
    character: Tiffany
    position: left
    message: 'This blue dress had better look flawless on me.

      Or should I
      wear both the blue and pink dresses? Like, one after the other?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: BNB
    stage: 5
    name: Tiffany
    character: Tiffany
    position: left
    message: 'Good evening, everyone. Welcome to my 30th birthday party!

      30
      is the new 20, right? A toast to eternal beauty and prosperity!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 0
    name: Scarlet
    character: Scarlet
    position: left
    message: Max, honey! Look what I found!
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 0
    name: Max
    character: Max
    position: right
    message: 'Wow, a photo taken on our first date. Where did you find it?

      Hard
      to believe it''s been five years!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 0
    name: Scarlet
    character: Scarlet
    position: left
    message: 'I know, right?

      I''m so glad I had the courage to ask you out
      to a Broadway musical after you found my purse at MoMA. It''s my favorite memory...'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 1
    name: Scarlet
    character: Scarlet
    position: left
    message: 'Where''s my purse? I remember taking my phone out of it.

      That
      guy has been sitting there for a while now. Maybe I should ask him.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 2
    name: Scarlet
    character: Scarlet
    position: left
    message: 'Thank you so much for finding my purse and nice to meet you, Max!

      You
      must love this artist! You''ve been sitting in front of his work for some time
      now.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 2
    name: Max
    character: Max
    position: right
    message: 'I do.

      And I gather you do, too, as you were sitting here staring
      at his painting with dreamy eyes when you left your purse.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 2
    name: Scarlet
    character: Scarlet
    position: left
    message: 'I''m a big fan!

      You know, there''s a musical about his life,
      premiering on Broadway this Saturday.

      Perhaps you''d like to go?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 3
    name: Scarlet
    character: Scarlet
    position: left
    message: Over here, Max! We are VIPs, no need to wait in line.
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 4
    name: Scarlet
    character: Scarlet
    position: left
    message: 'I''m loving this! This is the best after-party ever.

      How did
      you get us invited?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 4
    name: Max
    character: Max
    position: right
    message: 'Not only were we invited, we''re VIPs here, too.

      My parents
      host this party every year. I''m so glad you could come!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 4
    name: Scarlet
    character: Scarlet
    position: left
    message: "Oh, Max\u2026"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 5
    name: Max
    character: Max
    position: left
    message: 'It''s been 2 years since we met. I''ve never known a woman like you,
      Scarlet Clemonte.

      Will you marry me?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: RHT
    stage: 5
    name: Scarlet
    character: Scarlet
    position: right
    message: Oh my! Umm, yes, yes, I will!
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: TRH
    stage: 0
    name: William
    character: William
    position: left
    message: 'Hey, I''m William. You must be my new assistant!

      Professor Lopez
      told me you''re his star student in Mayan studies.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: TRH
    stage: 0
    name: William
    character: William
    position: left
    message: 'Did Lopez tell you about this project?

      His team just discovered
      incredible Mayan ruins in southern Mexico.

      So, you and I are going to
      finish researching Chichen Itza and then join them.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: TRH
    stage: 0
    name: William
    character: William
    position: left
    message: 'Is it your first time on a real archeological dig?

      Hey, no need
      to be anxious! Why don''t we get something to eat at that cafeteria?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: TRH
    stage: 1
    name: William
    character: William
    position: left
    message: 'The food here is amazing. Yucatan''s best! But the service, not so
      much.

      Do you see my food and drinks?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: TRH
    stage: 2
    name: William
    character: William
    position: left
    message: 'I dig the Antique Market. So many little treasures everywhere.

      Let''s
      get working!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: TRH
    stage: 3
    name: William
    character: William
    position: left
    message: 'This, my friend, is one of my favorite spots. It''s nature''s hidden
      treasure.

      Just look around!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: TRH
    stage: 4
    name: William
    character: William
    position: left
    message: Here we are! What a majestic sight! Keep an eye out for any treasure!
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: TRH
    stage: 5
    name: William
    character: William
    position: left
    message: 'Look at this hidden chamber! It''s the zenith of Mayan might.

      Come
      on, let''s find artifacts that will impress Lopez! '
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: DNW
    stage: 0
    name: Charlie
    character: Charlie
    position: left
    message: 'Hey, where were ya, new kid?

      C''mon! You''ve gotta be an early
      bird if you wanna work at a gold mine!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: DNW
    stage: 0
    name: Charlie
    character: Charlie
    position: left
    message: 'Oh, this? First time seeing dynamite?

      Hahaha! Don''t worry!
      Rookies don''t even get to touch these babies!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: DNW
    stage: 0
    name: Charlie
    character: Charlie
    position: left
    message: 'Whatcha waitin'' for? Go get your helmet and get movin''!

      We''ve
      got a long day ahead of us!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: DNW
    stage: 1
    name: Charlie
    character: Charlie
    position: left
    message: "Man, check this out! This is pure gold. Well\u2026almost, haha.\nHelp
      me find exactly what we need on this map."
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: DNW
    stage: 2
    name: Charlie
    character: Charlie
    position: left
    message: 'Here we are.

      Now we have some real work to do, kiddo. Move,
      move, move!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: DNW
    stage: 3
    name: Charlie
    character: Charlie
    position: left
    message: 'Ah, this is the best part! The boom and the flames!

      Look closely
      now and help me set this up right.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: DNW
    stage: 4
    name: Charlie
    character: Charlie
    position: left
    message: 'Oh my golly, what a beauty! Wow, it''s almost unbelievable.

      Come
      on! The real work begins now.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: DNW
    stage: 5
    name: Charlie
    character: Charlie
    position: left
    message: 'Man, we''ve got so much to show for our long day''s work!

      Feeling
      proud, kiddo? Ya did good work. Now help me put the treasures away.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: LGS
    stage: 0
    name: Cinderella
    character: Cinderella Poor
    position: left
    message: Today is the prince's birthday. There's going to be a grand ball at
      the castle tonight!
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: LGS
    stage: 0
    name: Cinderella
    character: Cinderella Poor
    position: left
    message: 'I wish I could go...

      If only there was some miracle and I could
      dance with the prince!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: LGS
    stage: 0
    name: Cinderella
    character: Cinderella Poor
    position: left
    message: "Do miracles even exist?\nI guess I should just be a good stepdaughter
      and clean the house while my stepsisters enjoy the party\u2026"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: LGS
    stage: 1
    name: Cinderella
    character: Cinderella Poor
    position: left
    message: "My stepmother and stepsisters have left for the ball.They were so excited
      to see the prince\u2026\nI wish I could attend! What a dream it would be! "
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: LGS
    stage: 2
    name: Cinderella
    character: Cinderella Poor
    position: left
    message: "Oh goodness, are you\u2026 my fairy godmother?\nOh, this dress is exactly
      what I've dreamt of! You turned a pumpkin into a coach for me, as well?\nThank
      you, thank you, thank you!"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: LGS
    stage: 3
    name: Cinderella
    character: Cinderella
    position: left
    message: "It's like in my dreams\u2026. I can't believe the prince is really
      dancing with me...!\nBut my fairy godmother told me to leave before midnight,
      or else the magic will disappear!"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: LGS
    stage: 4
    name: Cinderella
    character: Cinderella
    position: left
    message: 'Oh, no! My glass slipper! I don''t have time to pick it up! I need
      to go!

      Where is my pumpkin coach?'
    triggerAnim: Appeared
  - symbol: LGS
    stage: 5
    name: Cinderella
    character: Cinderella
    position: left
    message: 'The prince found my glass slipper and searched all over the country
      for me.

      I''m so happy! Everything feels like a fairytale. Or maybe it
      is!

      Thank you, fairy godmother!'
    triggerAnim: Appeared
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 0
    name: Miranda
    character: Miranda
    position: left
    message: 'Vegas, here we are! Oh, we''ll have the best time together.

'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 0
    name: Sasha
    character: Sasha
    position: right
    message: 'Time to get funky! Gotta get spinning already!

      Allison honey,
      stop fixing those lashes! You look stunning as always.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 0
    name: Allison
    character: Allison
    position: left
    message: 'Thanks, I guess I look all right.

      Hey, Chloe just texted. She
      is at the lobby. Let''s go find her!

      Woo-hoo! Vegas, I''m coming!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 1
    name: Chloe
    character: Chloe
    position: left
    message: 'Hey, what took you girls so long?

      I really want to head to the
      casino. The night is still young! '
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 2
    name: Sasha
    character: Sasha
    position: left
    message: 'Listen, y''all!

      Last night I dreamed that a huge buffalo ran
      straight towards me! It''s gotta be a sign.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 2
    name: Sasha
    character: Sasha
    position: left
    message: 'What do you say, maybe I''ll hit the grand jackpot in Buffalo, huh?

      Hey,
      there''s my Buffalo machine!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 3
    name: Chloe
    character: Chloe
    position: left
    message: See, Miranda! That's how you do it.
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 3
    name: Miranda
    character: Miranda
    position: right
    message: 'Amazing!

      Good for you Chloe, but I''m not that good at blackjack.

      I
      need more chips! Where''s my purse?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 4
    name: Allison
    character: Allison
    position: left
    message: 'Ah, don''t we deserve some fresh Vegas air?

      Oh wow, look at
      all these crazy neon lights! Let''s take a selfie near that huge casino sign!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 5
    name: Miranda
    character: Miranda
    position: left
    message: 'What a night!

      It''s so nice dining out here after all that spinning,
      don''t you think?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 5
    name: Allison
    character: Allison
    position: right
    message: 'And look at that fountain! It''s incredible!

      Girls, I''m really
      happy we all made it here this holiday. We should definitely come back. '
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: VGN
    stage: 5
    name: Chloe
    character: Chloe
    position: left
    message: 'Of course, Allison!

      And you know the rule, what happens in Vegas
      stays in Vegas!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: CRC
    stage: 0
    name: Mary
    character: Mary
    position: left
    message: Anne, over here! I just heard something you will love from this one-legged
      man!
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: CRC
    stage: 0
    name: Anne
    character: Anne
    position: right
    message: 'Phew! This tavern is crowded as hell! What is it, Mary?

      If it''s
      more fake treasure island rubbish, that old man will lose his other leg!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: CRC
    stage: 0
    name: Mary
    character: Mary
    position: left
    message: 'No, Anne! I think this man really knows something!

      Just sit
      down already and listen to what he says!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: CRC
    stage: 1
    name: Anne
    character: Anne
    position: left
    message: 'Wait, old man! You have the real map to the famous Skull Island treasures?
      Are you sure?

      Wow, I heard it was lost 100 years ago!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: CRC
    stage: 2
    name: Anne
    character: Anne
    position: left
    message: 'Ah-ha! This is the map to that notorious treasure island!

      Mary,
      are you ready for another adventure?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: CRC
    stage: 3
    name: Mary
    character: Mary
    position: left
    message: There it is, Anne! I see the island!
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: CRC
    stage: 3
    name: Anne
    character: Anne
    position: right
    message: Did you hear that, pirates? Well, what are you waiting for? Prepare
      the anchor!
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: CRC
    stage: 4
    name: Anne
    character: Anne
    position: left
    message: 'Mary, come over here! There''s the cave with three entrances! Just
      like in the map!

      Wow, it really looks like a skull. I can''t believe
      that man was right!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: CRC
    stage: 5
    name: Anne
    character: Anne
    position: left
    message: 'Mary, we made it! We''re rich now!

      What should we do with all
      of this treasure? End this risky pirate''s life, settle down, and live peacefully?
      Haha!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: CRC
    stage: 5
    name: Mary
    character: Mary
    position: right
    message: 'Ha! You and a peaceful life? You must be kidding!

      Why don''t
      we go back to the tavern and have a few drinks first!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 0
    name: Johnny
    character: Johnny
    position: left
    message: 'Hi! I''m Johnny. Are you also a freshman?

      I almost got lost
      searching for this classroom.

      This is Monster 101 class, right?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 0
    name: Johnny
    character: Johnny
    position: left
    message: "Can you believe it? I really didn't expect I would make it to Monster
      University.\nYou know, it's the best place to learn how to scare humans!\nMy
      dad cried when I got the letter. Anyway\u2026"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 0
    name: Johnny
    character: Johnny
    position: left
    message: "Wait! Who's that green monster? Do you see that girl walking in?\nShe's
      so dreamy\u2026 Look at her slimy green tail\u2026."
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 1
    name: Johnny
    character: Johnny
    position: left
    message: "I want to know her name\u2026 She's sitting just a few rows in front
      of me.\r\nPsst! Hey, do you see her notebook on her desk?\r\nI think her name
      is written on the cover of it. Can you read it?\r"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 2
    name: Johnny
    character: Johnny
    position: left
    message: "I couldn't focus on the class at all. Doris\u2026Are you sure that's
      her name?\nBut she's way out of my league\u2026\n"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 2
    name: Doris
    character: Doris
    position: right
    message: "Hey, hi! Yes, that's my name! You're\u2026 Johnny, right?\nAhaha, I
      could feel your three eyes staring at me from behind during the whole class.
      I guess I'll see you later!"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 2
    name: Johnny
    character: Johnny
    position: left
    message: Oh, shoot! She heard me! But at least she knows my name!
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 3
    name: Johnny
    character: Johnny
    position: left
    message: "Doris is a cheerleader, too\u2026. Look at her\u2026. She's so perfect.\r\nWell,
      what do you think? Do you think I have a shot with her?\r\n\u2026 Never mind.\r"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 4
    name: Doris
    character: Doris
    position: left
    message: 'Hi, Johnny and Johnny''s friend! Can I join you guys?

      I can''t
      find my friends.'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 4
    name: Johnny
    character: Johnny
    position: right
    message: "Uhhh\u2026Sure! I'll grab a chair for you!"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: MON
    stage: 5
    name: Johnny
    character: Johnny
    position: left
    message: "Come on! Stuck in the library on the first day of university?\r\nI
      need your help! Should I ask Doris out?\nUrgh\u2026. What should I do?"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: XMV
    stage: 0
    name: Santa
    character: Santa
    position: left
    message: Ho-ho-ho! We finished this year's Nice List, finally!
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: XMV
    stage: 0
    name: Santa
    character: Santa
    position: left
    message: "Hmm? What is it, Rudolph?\r\nI missed a boy? Who is it?\r"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: XMV
    stage: 0
    name: Santa
    character: Santa
    position: left
    message: "Are you sure he's been nice this year?\nLet's have a look\u2026. Where
      is this little boy right now?"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: XMV
    stage: 1
    name: Santa
    character: Santa
    position: left
    message: "Oh\u2026what a special young man.\nI'm going to make this a Christmas
      he won't soon forget. "
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: XMV
    stage: 2
    name: Santa
    character: Santa
    position: left
    message: "You barely made the Nice list this year, Johnny.\nSusie, well, hopefully
      you make the Nice list next year\u2026"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: XMV
    stage: 3
    name: Santa
    character: Santa
    position: left
    message: 'You there, how are the toys coming along?

      Will they be finished
      in time for Christmas?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: XMV
    stage: 4
    name: Santa
    character: Santa
    position: left
    message: 'Ho-ho-ho, it''s that time again, boys.

      I hope you''re well-rested
      - We have a long night ahead of us!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: XMV
    stage: 5
    name: Santa
    character: Santa
    position: left
    message: Merry Christmas to all, and to all a good night! Ho-ho-ho!
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 0
    name: Dr. Jekyll
    character: Dr. Jekyll
    position: left
    message: <i>My dear Utterson, when this letter reaches your hands, I shall have
      disappeared already.</i>
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 0
    name: Dr. Jekyll
    character: Dr. Jekyll
    position: left
    message: "<i>But if you care to learn more about what happened, turn to the confession
      of \u201CYour unworthy and unhappy friend, HENRY JEKYLL.\u201D</i>"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 0
    name: Dr. Jekyll
    character: Dr. Jekyll
    position: left
    message: "<i>It all began when I finally found the formula for this powerful
      potion.\nThat evil potion that brought the most despicable man we know into
      this world\u2026</i>"
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 1
    name: Dr. Jekyll
    character: Dr. Jekyll
    position: left
    message: '<i>Yes, Utterson, I''m talking about Mr. Hyde.

      You must have
      been curious how I, the generous, well-respected Dr. Henry Jekyll, knew such
      a disgusting man.</ui>'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 1
    name: Hyde
    character: Hyde
    position: right
    message: 'What? Why should I buy your useless matches?

      I don''t care about
      your pathetic family! Get out of my way, you useless pig!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 2
    name: Jekyll's friend
    character: 
    position: left
    message: 'What a great man you are, Jekyll! To host an event like this to benefit
      the poor children selling matches!

      How''s your study going these days,
      by the way? Rumor has it that you made some magic potion?'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 2
    name: Dr. Jekyll
    character: Dr. Jekyll
    position: right
    message: 'Oh thank you, my friend. I''m afraid I must go to bed now though before
      facing a new day tomorrow. My studies require me to be fully rested.

      Tomorrow
      is a new day and I want to start it off right!'
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 3
    name: Dr. Jekyll
    character: Dr. Jekyll
    position: left
    message: "Oh, no, no, no, no! Hyde finally killed a man! It's all over the newspaper!\nThis
      will destroy my reputation, my whole life!\nI need to keep my hands off that
      cursed potion\u2026."
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 4
    name: Dr. Jekyll
    character: Dr. Jekyll
    position: left
    message: "What have I done? I wish I could go back in time and undo everything\u2026\nOh
      God, please at least let me end all of this as myself, as the good man I am."
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 5
    name: Dr. Jekyll
    character: Dr. Jekyll
    position: left
    message: <i>However, things got completely out of hand, and I cannot stay as
      myself without the influence of the potion even while writing this letter.</i>
    triggerAnim: 
  - symbol: WWH
    stage: 5
    name: Dr. Jekyll
    character: Dr. Jekyll
    position: left
    message: "<i>I know that this is truly the end of Henry Jekyll\u2026 and what
      is to follow concerns more than myself.\nMy last wish is that you find this
      letter in my study.\nFarewell, my friend.</i>"
